            "review_title": "Review at Stir Crazy Mongolian Grill/BBQ",
            "review_text": "Anh N\n4 contributions\n0\nGrill and BBQ for locals Saigonese. It is cheap price\nSep 2016\nA place in Go Vap district, this restaurant supply food for grill and BBQ, you just come and seat at small table and look up menu list and order your dish.\nEach dish for 2 persons and you can order other dish like BBQ meat, Extra more noodle, vegs and join local beers.\nWritten September 11, 2016",
