            "review_title": "Review at Stir Crazy Mongolian Grill/BBQ",
            "review_text": "DJoshuaP\nWashington DC, District of Columbia9 contributions\n0\nNever been to Mongolia, but tasted like home!\nJul 2016 • Couples\nAs far as authentic Mongolian, I can't be the judge... But as far as matching every expectations I have of a Mongolian grill, Stir Crazy is 100%. I have been three times since opening, once with business partners, once with friends, and once with my girlfriend. All three times have been nothing short of perfect. \n\nThe sauces are absolutely amazing and give you the freedom to create your own concoction... But if you don't fancy being creative and doing it yourself, they have plenty of pre-planned recipes you can easily follow.\n\nAll in all, one of my favorite places in Sai Gon. My only complaint is it isn't closer to where I live.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten July 26, 2016",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-14",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
