            "review_title": "Review at Stir Crazy Mongolian Grill/BBQ",
            "review_text": "Bryant P\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam6 contributions\n0\nGood eats, good drinks, great service\nJul 2016 • Friends\nJust do the All You Can Eat meal and dig in. There's so many cuts of quality meat and seafood to choose from, as well as many fresh vegetables and delicious sauces. The drinks were pretty dang cheap considering it's an expat restaurant. The owner is super friendly and all of his staff are attentive and competent in English - outstanding considering you don't find too many entire restaurants like this outside of D1. Give it a try, invite all your friends, and wear your 'thanksgiving dinner' pants because you're sure to leave stuffed!\nRead more\nWritten July 26, 2016",
