            "review_title": "Review at Stir Crazy Mongolian Grill/BBQ",
            "review_text": "MichaelMasters\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam5 contributions\n0\nMeat Meat Meat!!!!\nJul 2016 • Friends\nI was honestly amazed at the quality of meat at Stir Crazy. I have been to many many places that serve \"the same\" meat around HCM but all I got was poor quality knuckles and faces. Here they have fantastic goat, pork, beef and tons of western veg that I miss so badly. There is no waiting, the food is fresh to order, they don't run out of what you want and it is bloody delicious. The only thing I recommend is that you go here with a very empty stomach and a raving appetite. Very fun, very good, and absolutely delicious.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten July 26, 2016",
